---
layout: layouts/base.njk
design: v2
article: true
---
{#- v2 article layout for prose pages (support guides, docs, legal, changelog).
	The page body keeps its v1 markup (eyebrow, h1, lede, hero-actions, section-blocks,
	cta-block); splitHero lifts the opening block into a hero band and article.css
	restyles the rest. See VoiceTel-Design/page-migration-plan.md § Tier 2. -#}
{%- set parts = content | splitHero %}
<section class="hero hero--page hero--article">
	<div class="container container--article">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			{{- parts.hero | safe }}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
<article class="article">
	<div class="container container--article">
		{{- parts.body | safe }}
	</div>
</article>
